```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "NighttimeUrbanIntersection" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasObstacle :roadObject1, :roadObject2 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2, :risk3 .

:actor1 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Black vehicle in foreground" .
:actor2 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Yellow vehicle approaching from right" .
:actor3 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Orange vehicle in distance" .

:roadObject1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Traffic light showing red" .
:roadObject2 a :Billboard ;
    :description "Billboard in distance" .

:weather1 a :NightCondition .

:risk1 a :RearEndCollisionRisk ;
    :description "Potential rear-end collision risk due to following distance" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :CollisionRisk ;
    :description "Potential collision risk with yellow vehicle at intersection" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:risk3 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Occlusion risk due to limited visibility at night" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev3 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.65"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.70"^^xsd:float .

:sev3 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.55"^^xsd:float .
```

### Identified Risks for each risk class

**Risk 1:**
Description: Potential rear-end collision risk due to following distance
Severity Score: 0.65

**Risk 2:**
Description: Potential collision risk with yellow vehicle at intersection
Severity Score: 0.70

**Risk 3:**
Description: Occlusion risk due to limited visibility at night
Severity Score: 0.55